            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>12.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[First release.

- Keeps the MacBook Pro lid logo lit at the brightness you set, whatever the screen brightness is.
- Works in clamshell mode while an external display is connected.
- Fades the logo in and out, and turns it off when the Mac sleeps.
- Menu bar app with open at login, automatic updates and 8 languages.

Requires a MacBook Pro with PROLED XDR display and macOS 27.2 or later. Tested on the 16-inch M5 Pro.
]]></description>
